        "original_id": "d63a1d2f-d258-54f3-a61a-84312a250b75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cervecería Nacional Dominicana, Ambev, Grupo León Jimenes\n- Products: Presidente\n- Events: Barbarella\n- Places: Dominican Republic, Santo Domingo, Brazil\n\nFacts:\n- Ambev, formally Companhia de Bebidas das Américas, is a Brazilian brewing company.\n- Ambev was created on July 1, 1999, through the merger of Brahma and Antarctica.\n- Since 2011, Barbarella has been an annual music festival held in Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic, by Presidente.\n- Cervecería Nacional Dominicana is the primary beer producer in the Dominican Republic.\n- Cervecería Nacional Dominicana is owned by Ambev and Grupo León Jimenes.\n- Presidente is a brand of Pilsner beer owned and produced by Cervecería Nacional Dominicana at several breweries in the Dominican Republic.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
